/*

======================================================
|Índice(i) | Cálculo v[i]=(i +1)*3 | Valor Armazenado|
|----------|-----------------------|-----------------|
|0         |  (0 + 1 ) * 3         |3                |
|1         |  (1 + 1 ) * 3         |6                |
|2         |  (2 + 1 ) * 3         |9                |
|3         |  (3 + 1 ) * 3         |12               |
|4         |  (4 + 1 ) * 3         |15               |
======================================================

SAÍDA DO PROGRAMA:

v[0] = 3
v[2] = 9
v[4] = 15
v[1] + v[3] = 6 + 12 = 18

 */